WEBVTT

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:07.050
I wonder what it will be?  
This week, it’s this!

00:00:08.620 --> 00:00:12.940
By discarding a card from your hand, you 
gain control of your opponent’s monster!

00:00:12.940 --> 00:00:14.990
That’s a formidable monster.

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:22.880
Dark Signers…

00:00:24.510 --> 00:00:26.540
I'll never forgive you!

00:00:26.540 --> 00:00:28.540
Young girl....

00:00:29.930 --> 00:00:30.980
That’s…

00:00:31.750 --> 00:00:34.710
This is supposed to be your card.

00:00:34.710 --> 00:00:39.530
If you want this card back, battle me.

00:00:39.530 --> 00:00:41.760
I won’t run or hide.

00:00:42.170 --> 00:00:43.990
My name is Demak.

00:00:44.530 --> 00:00:47.230
I'm the Dark Signer with the Cusillu mark.

00:00:56.150 --> 00:01:00.770
For every star of destiny, we'll 
meet at our destined location.

00:01:06.310 --> 00:01:09.490
Wait!  We’re ending this here!

00:01:09.490 --> 00:01:10.310
Yusei!

00:01:10.880 --> 00:01:12.520
Master Atlas!

00:01:12.520 --> 00:01:13.990
Dark Signers!

00:01:14.520 --> 00:01:17.740
Don’t run away!  Let's finish this!

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:21.640
Don’t be impatient, Yusei Fudo.

00:01:21.640 --> 00:01:24.660
We've already prepared the 
final stage for our battles.

00:01:24.880 --> 00:01:28.670
I don’t care about that!  
Battle me right here, right now!

00:01:28.670 --> 00:01:33.850
Come to the locations marked by the 
stars of destiny.  Obey your fate.

00:01:34.140 --> 00:01:36.270
Wait!  Battle me!

00:01:36.270 --> 00:01:39.580
Duel against me!

00:01:41.940 --> 00:01:43.320
Hey, wait!

00:01:43.820 --> 00:01:46.850
I need to talk to you!

00:01:53.080 --> 00:01:55.380
Like I thought, you’re…

00:01:56.010 --> 00:01:58.340
Carly!  Am I right?

00:02:00.040 --> 00:02:01.140
Jack…

00:02:01.630 --> 00:02:03.440
No way…

00:02:03.440 --> 00:02:05.640
Why are you a Dark Signer?

00:02:06.400 --> 00:02:08.570
If you want to know the answer...

00:02:09.670 --> 00:02:14.040
Come meet me, Jack my love.

00:02:31.910 --> 00:02:36.650
Looking over a vast distance

00:02:36.910 --> 00:02:41.750
I realized my field of vision was narrow

00:02:42.020 --> 00:02:46.660
Even if it’s easier to throw myself away

00:02:47.020 --> 00:02:51.430
I want to survive to the best of my abilities

00:02:53.290 --> 00:02:56.790
No matter how bad today is

00:02:58.370 --> 00:03:01.780
There’s still the faintest light

00:03:03.540 --> 00:03:07.180
All I have to do tomorrow

00:03:07.470 --> 00:03:11.240
Is light it myself

00:03:11.550 --> 00:03:16.250
I test myself so I won’t stop or vanish

00:03:16.620 --> 00:03:21.220
Even if I get countless scars

00:03:21.720 --> 00:03:27.520
I ride wishing for the 
arrival of a true tomorrow

00:03:27.830 --> 00:03:31.500
Today will never exist again

00:03:31.830 --> 00:03:37.400
So I won’t stop or vanish

00:04:00.840 --> 00:04:06.310
The Man with the Mark of the Monkey Geoglyph

00:04:10.060 --> 00:04:12.510
I’m sorry!  It’s my fault.

00:04:13.020 --> 00:04:16.260
It’s because Martha saved me.

00:04:16.760 --> 00:04:19.530
I see.  Martha was…

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:21.760
I’m sorry.

00:04:22.050 --> 00:04:24.600
It happened while I was with her.

00:04:24.600 --> 00:04:27.710
If I was able to grab Martha’s hand...

00:04:34.480 --> 00:04:36.120
Forgive me!

00:04:36.120 --> 00:04:38.470
You’re wrong!  It’s 
not your fault, Ushio!

00:04:38.470 --> 00:04:41.070
If I never went there in the first place…

00:04:41.070 --> 00:04:44.050
It’s all our fault!

00:04:49.560 --> 00:04:52.200
Stop crying!

00:04:52.200 --> 00:04:54.420
It’s not your fault!

00:04:54.420 --> 00:04:57.800
Exactly.  It’s not your fault.

00:04:57.850 --> 00:04:59.970
It’s the Dark Signers’ fault.

00:05:00.790 --> 00:05:04.720
They not only did that to 
Martha, but also to Rally.

00:05:05.010 --> 00:05:06.360
Rally!

00:05:10.080 --> 00:05:16.060
In order to get Martha and Rally back, 
we have to defeat the Dark Signers!

00:05:19.610 --> 00:05:23.300
Wait, does that mean Martha isn’t dead?

00:05:23.300 --> 00:05:24.020
That's right.

00:05:24.590 --> 00:05:26.040
What do you mean?

00:05:26.040 --> 00:05:31.010
Right now, something unbelievable is 
happening in Satellite and the City.

00:05:32.330 --> 00:05:40.070
The appearance of geoglyphs, the mysterious 
fog covering Satellite, everyone who vanished…

00:05:40.420 --> 00:05:42.710
Martha and Rally…

00:05:43.000 --> 00:05:46.400
The Dark Signers have caused this all.

00:05:47.160 --> 00:05:51.280
So if you defeat them, Martha will come back?

00:05:51.280 --> 00:05:52.350
Yes.

00:05:52.350 --> 00:05:54.300
Is that true, Yusei?

00:05:54.300 --> 00:05:55.490
Yusei!

00:05:55.490 --> 00:05:57.500
Yes, it’s true.

00:05:58.830 --> 00:06:04.680
We are going to defeat the Dark 
Signers, so you have to stop crying.

00:06:04.680 --> 00:06:07.300
We promise to bring Martha back.

00:06:09.940 --> 00:06:14.720
We'll leave when we’re ready.  
You don’t need to see us off.

00:06:14.720 --> 00:06:15.490
I see.

00:06:15.890 --> 00:06:18.460
I’m counting on you, Yusei.

00:06:20.140 --> 00:06:22.460
Now go to bed.

00:06:23.350 --> 00:06:25.140
Good night, Yusei.

00:06:31.140 --> 00:06:34.360
Yusei, is what you said true?

00:06:34.360 --> 00:06:38.990
If we defeat the Dark Signers, 
will the missing people return?

00:06:40.820 --> 00:06:42.010
Well?

00:06:42.580 --> 00:06:43.810
I don’t know.

00:06:43.810 --> 00:06:44.550
What?

00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:47.050
What do you mean, Yusei?

00:06:47.050 --> 00:06:50.490
It’s just what I want to believe.

00:06:53.720 --> 00:06:54.930
Damn!

00:06:55.100 --> 00:06:58.130
What's the point of lying?

00:06:58.130 --> 00:06:59.010
Stop it!

00:06:59.010 --> 00:07:02.880
Since Martha and Rally 
are gone, Yusei is sad!

00:07:03.920 --> 00:07:04.920
Damn!

00:07:05.300 --> 00:07:08.940
I’ll believe that Yusei spoke the truth.

00:07:08.940 --> 00:07:12.450
If we defeat them, everyone will return.

00:07:12.480 --> 00:07:17.070
You just want to believe that because you 
feel guilty for everything you've done!

00:07:17.070 --> 00:07:18.680
You may be right.

00:07:19.030 --> 00:07:21.070
But starting now, things are different!

00:07:21.070 --> 00:07:23.900
I want to duel in order to protect everyone!

00:07:23.900 --> 00:07:28.030
I want to believe that our futures 
are connected beyond the duel!

00:07:28.280 --> 00:07:30.580
Aki may be right.

00:07:30.580 --> 00:07:31.770
Mikage...

00:07:31.770 --> 00:07:35.470
We must close the door to the underworld.

00:07:35.640 --> 00:07:36.880
Exactly.

00:07:36.880 --> 00:07:39.670
We have to believe in our future.

00:07:42.670 --> 00:07:44.680
Our future…

00:07:45.400 --> 00:07:50.120
They said that they'll be waiting 
at the four stars of destiny.

00:07:50.120 --> 00:07:51.850
What are the stars of destiny?

00:07:51.850 --> 00:07:57.330
They're probably the four control units 
that maintained the previous Moment.

00:07:57.330 --> 00:07:58.510
Control units?

00:07:58.510 --> 00:08:03.720
Their seals were broken right before the 
previous Moment went out of control.

00:08:03.720 --> 00:08:07.530
Those control units had four code names.

00:08:07.530 --> 00:08:12.090
Ccapac Apu, Ccarayhua, 
Asila Piscu and Cusillu.

00:08:12.090 --> 00:08:17.910
In the Quechua language, they mean 
giant, lizard, hummingbird and monkey.

00:08:17.910 --> 00:08:20.360
Those were the geoglyphs that vanished.

00:08:20.360 --> 00:08:22.550
But the spider is missing.

00:08:22.550 --> 00:08:27.830
The spider is Uru, the code name 
for the previous Moment itself.

00:08:27.830 --> 00:08:33.370
In order to seal the previous Moment, 
you must turn on those control units.

00:08:33.370 --> 00:08:37.050
So Rutger is the boss of the Dark Signers?

00:08:37.050 --> 00:08:40.500
He’s telling us to face him 
after we defeat the other four.

00:08:40.500 --> 00:08:42.840
The cards that you're using…

00:08:42.840 --> 00:08:48.040
Ancient Fairy Dragon is still 
in the enemy’s hands,

00:08:48.040 --> 00:08:53.040
but those cards were used 
to seal the control units.

00:08:53.040 --> 00:08:54.710
Is that true?

00:08:54.710 --> 00:08:58.700
Professor Fudo entrusted 
those cards to the Director.

00:08:58.700 --> 00:09:00.420
My father?

00:09:00.840 --> 00:09:02.130
Can it be?

00:09:02.130 --> 00:09:03.900
Then that means the seals were…

00:09:04.750 --> 00:09:09.830
Professor Fudo was the 
one who broke the seals?

00:09:10.030 --> 00:09:12.360
No, that's incorrect.

00:09:12.360 --> 00:09:17.300
He tried to stop the previous 
Moment from going out of control.

00:09:18.000 --> 00:09:23.010
Professor Fudo took the removed 
cards and entrusted them to me.

00:09:24.070 --> 00:09:27.480
Did Godwin say anything about my father?

00:09:27.660 --> 00:09:31.220
No, that was everything he told me.

00:09:31.220 --> 00:09:34.950
Why does Yusei and the rest have those cards?

00:09:34.950 --> 00:09:36.420
Because…

00:09:36.980 --> 00:09:41.760
As for the cards that Professor Fudo 
gave me, I released them into the wild.

00:09:41.760 --> 00:09:46.790
The Signers will eventually use the 
cards and serve the Crimson Dragon.

00:09:48.400 --> 00:09:55.100
Until then, the cards will pass from person to 
person, in search of owners who can masters them.

00:09:55.670 --> 00:10:02.030
Using the power of the Public Maintenance 
Department, I observed who attained those cards.

00:10:02.030 --> 00:10:11.060
I confirmed that the cards passed into the 
hands of Jack Atlas, Yusei Fudo and Aki Izayoi.

00:10:11.940 --> 00:10:18.210
These duelists are the Signers who 
will battle against the Dark Signers!

00:10:23.020 --> 00:10:29.740
Even after everything, Godwin 
has always been controlling us.

00:10:29.740 --> 00:10:33.030
However, the Director has 
no further predictions.

00:10:33.030 --> 00:10:35.520
The die has been cast.

00:10:35.520 --> 00:10:39.700
Only you Signers can stop the Dark Signers.

00:10:39.700 --> 00:10:44.270
The future of the world is in your hands.

00:10:47.700 --> 00:10:53.680
The location of the four control units are 
giant, hummingbird, lizard and monkey.

00:10:53.680 --> 00:10:55.330
These four locations.

00:10:55.330 --> 00:10:58.340
Should we go to each location one-by-one?

00:10:58.340 --> 00:11:04.000
That’s a waste of time.  Besides, the 
duels are one-on-one.  I'll go alone.

00:11:04.000 --> 00:11:09.220
If this mark of the Crimson Dragon yearns 
for a duel against a Dark Signer,

00:11:09.220 --> 00:11:12.220
then there’s no point in sticking together.

00:11:12.220 --> 00:11:15.050
But we just finally become a team...

00:11:15.050 --> 00:11:16.790
Jack is right.

00:11:17.220 --> 00:11:20.790
Even if we’re apart, we’re still a team.

00:11:21.000 --> 00:11:22.320
Yusei…

00:11:22.320 --> 00:11:24.050
Who will you face?

00:11:24.430 --> 00:11:28.330
Kiryu probably has the mark of the giant.

00:11:28.330 --> 00:11:30.230
I'll go there.

00:11:30.750 --> 00:11:32.240
Misty is the lizard.

00:11:32.450 --> 00:11:34.450
I’ll go there.

00:11:34.450 --> 00:11:36.210
Demak is the monkey.

00:11:36.670 --> 00:11:40.210
I want to get Ancient Fairy Dragon back!

00:11:40.420 --> 00:11:42.430
I’m going to support Luca!

00:11:42.430 --> 00:11:43.910
The hummingbird is…

00:11:44.180 --> 00:11:48.440
If you want to know the answer, come meet me.

00:11:48.440 --> 00:11:50.020
I’ll go there.

00:11:50.270 --> 00:11:53.660
All right, I’ll take 
Lua and Luca in my car.

00:11:54.740 --> 00:11:57.070
Aki, you'll take my car.

00:11:57.070 --> 00:11:57.860
Okay.

00:11:57.860 --> 00:12:00.180
So I have to stay home again?

00:12:00.180 --> 00:12:04.490
I’ll watch the kids, so don’t worry.

00:12:04.490 --> 00:12:05.310
Okay!

00:12:05.970 --> 00:12:08.710
We leave first thing tomorrow morning!

00:12:28.040 --> 00:12:30.400
Will you be okay, Luca and Lua?

00:12:31.060 --> 00:12:32.880
I'll be by her side!

00:12:33.330 --> 00:12:34.330
Understood.

00:12:34.490 --> 00:12:38.800
From this moment forward, winning or 
losing will depend on your skills!

00:12:39.020 --> 00:12:43.460
The Dark Signers won't be defeated easily.

00:12:43.460 --> 00:12:46.010
I'm certain that our battles will be tough.

00:12:46.010 --> 00:12:51.480
But that's when you should 
remember each of your friends!

00:12:51.770 --> 00:12:55.610
Even when we’re apart, we’re 
connected by a strong bond!

00:12:56.190 --> 00:12:59.230
Everyone, let's win so 
that we can meet again!

00:13:02.190 --> 00:13:03.930
Give it your all!

00:13:10.780 --> 00:13:12.200
Carly…

00:13:21.390 --> 00:13:23.080
Why are you…

00:13:33.190 --> 00:13:34.120
Hey.

00:13:35.640 --> 00:13:38.130
Don’t scare me, Luca!

00:13:38.130 --> 00:13:40.360
How about you not scaring me!

00:13:40.870 --> 00:13:45.080
You and the crows scared me so much 
that I almost lost my courage.

00:13:45.080 --> 00:13:48.110
I’m sorry for forcing you to help me.

00:13:48.670 --> 00:13:52.040
What are you talking 
about?  We’re siblings!

00:13:52.040 --> 00:13:56.040
I'll protect you forever, 
Luca!  Oh, that reminds me!

00:13:57.580 --> 00:13:58.850
Ta daa!

00:13:59.030 --> 00:14:01.890
Lua, what’s the point of 
you wearing a Duel Disk?

00:14:02.180 --> 00:14:06.360
For spirit!  Now bring it, Dark Signers!

00:14:06.360 --> 00:14:07.490
Not again…

00:14:07.490 --> 00:14:09.440
I’m the one who’s going to be dueling.

00:14:08.830 --> 00:14:10.610
He’s so simple-minded.

00:14:19.570 --> 00:14:21.030
What’s wrong, Luca?

00:14:21.030 --> 00:14:22.820
I heard a scream.

00:14:22.820 --> 00:14:25.020
A scream?  Is someone here?

00:14:25.020 --> 00:14:31.540
No…  I’ve heard it before, but it’s 
become more frequent since I arrived at Satellite.

00:14:31.860 --> 00:14:35.570
I think someone from the 
spirit world is calling me.

00:14:35.570 --> 00:14:38.120
Do you mean Ancient Fairy Dragon?

00:14:38.120 --> 00:14:41.010
What do you mean by the spirit world?

00:14:41.010 --> 00:14:44.260
Luca can talk to Duel Monsters spirits.

00:14:45.330 --> 00:14:47.470
C’mon, that's nonsense.

00:14:47.470 --> 00:14:48.940
It’s true!

00:14:48.940 --> 00:14:54.010
You expect me to believe that?  
Sheesh, this is why kids are lame.

00:14:54.270 --> 00:14:57.660
Sheesh, this is why adults are lame.

00:14:57.660 --> 00:15:01.510
I bet Luca was chosen to be a 
Signer because she has this power.

00:15:05.970 --> 00:15:07.720
What’s wrong, Kuribon?

00:15:09.400 --> 00:15:11.920
Something is happening in the spirit world?

00:15:12.390 --> 00:15:14.030
Who are you talking to?

00:15:14.030 --> 00:15:15.190
Okay, I understand.

00:15:24.010 --> 00:15:26.540
That’s coming from Luca's direction.

00:15:35.590 --> 00:15:37.700
What just happened?

00:15:39.150 --> 00:15:40.380
Luca!

00:15:40.780 --> 00:15:42.040
What’s wrong?

00:15:42.040 --> 00:15:43.170
Luca is missing!

00:15:43.170 --> 00:15:43.850
What?

00:15:44.060 --> 00:15:47.420
The light took Luca!

00:15:47.420 --> 00:15:51.670
Are you saying that she was 
taken to the spirit world?

00:15:51.670 --> 00:15:52.460
Yeah.

00:15:52.460 --> 00:15:54.690
You idiot!  There’s no way that’s true!

00:15:54.690 --> 00:15:56.020
It’s true!

00:15:56.020 --> 00:15:59.570
Maybe she fell out of the 
car.  Let’s search the area.

00:15:59.760 --> 00:16:00.740
Listen to me!

00:16:00.740 --> 00:16:02.530
Hey, Luca!

00:16:02.530 --> 00:16:05.050
You’re so stubborn.

00:16:05.430 --> 00:16:09.010
But if she did fall out of 
the car, that would be bad.

00:16:09.010 --> 00:16:11.980
Luca, where are you?

00:16:12.160 --> 00:16:14.550
Luca!  You’re not here, right?

00:16:14.550 --> 00:16:16.500
But if you are, answer me!

00:16:16.500 --> 00:16:18.220
Luca!

00:16:18.220 --> 00:16:19.960
Damn, she’s not here either.

00:16:19.960 --> 00:16:21.450
Luca!

00:16:21.760 --> 00:16:23.270
Luca!

00:16:23.270 --> 00:16:24.930
Luca!

00:16:24.930 --> 00:16:27.170
Luca!

00:16:38.220 --> 00:16:41.240
That’s the mark of the monkey.

00:16:41.650 --> 00:16:46.120
Is Luca trapped inside?

00:16:46.660 --> 00:16:50.240
Luca, answer me if you’re here!

00:16:50.240 --> 00:16:52.890
I was waiting for you, Signer.

00:17:04.190 --> 00:17:07.560
That’s the geoglyph of Luca's opponent.

00:17:10.080 --> 00:17:11.640
It’s started.

00:17:12.610 --> 00:17:15.990
This is the monkey geoglyph.  That means…

00:17:17.580 --> 00:17:19.080
Who are you?

00:17:19.360 --> 00:17:21.560
You’re not a Signer.

00:17:22.510 --> 00:17:26.750
So what?  I promised to protect Luca!

00:17:28.110 --> 00:17:28.990
Lua!

00:17:28.990 --> 00:17:30.990
You’re a fool.

00:17:30.990 --> 00:17:34.340
You came to this tower even 
though you’re not a Signer?

00:17:34.340 --> 00:17:36.040
Did you come here to die?

00:17:36.040 --> 00:17:37.490
This is what I wanted!

00:17:37.490 --> 00:17:40.010
All I have to do is defeat you in a duel!

00:17:40.010 --> 00:17:44.570
If I defeat you, Luca won’t 
have to face any danger.

00:17:44.570 --> 00:17:46.570
In that case, I’ll be your opponent!

00:17:46.940 --> 00:17:49.570
I admire your enthusiasm.

00:17:49.570 --> 00:17:53.980
However, non-Signers cannot defeat us.

00:17:53.980 --> 00:17:55.690
You don’t know that for sure!

00:17:55.690 --> 00:17:58.540
Then battle me, kid.

00:18:00.150 --> 00:18:01.340
Duel!

00:18:04.730 --> 00:18:07.260
Stop, Lua!  Don’t be hasty!

00:18:09.200 --> 00:18:11.670
Yusei, why are you here?

00:18:12.200 --> 00:18:15.410
I came back after seeing 
the light.  What happened?

00:18:15.410 --> 00:18:18.430
Luca disappeared into the light.

00:18:18.430 --> 00:18:19.220
What?

00:18:19.510 --> 00:18:24.010
Ancient Fairy Dragon is sealed 
away in the spirit world.

00:18:24.010 --> 00:18:27.560
Yusei, even you believe that fairy tale?

00:18:27.560 --> 00:18:29.140
It’s not a fairy tale!

00:18:29.140 --> 00:18:33.160
Since Luca will use its power, 
she went to free the dragon.

00:18:33.160 --> 00:18:34.270
What?

00:18:34.270 --> 00:18:37.410
But more importantly, we have 
to do something about this duel.

00:18:37.410 --> 00:18:41.760
Hey, stop!  That child is not 
a Signer!  Stop this duel!

00:18:41.760 --> 00:18:46.570
Too bad.  Once a shadow duel 
begins, it cannot be stopped.

00:18:46.730 --> 00:18:49.040
At least not until the duel ends.

00:18:50.510 --> 00:18:54.820
I’ll go first!  My turn!  I draw!

00:18:55.850 --> 00:19:00.800
All right!  I summon Morphtronic 
Magnen in defense position!

00:19:04.230 --> 00:19:09.390
When this card is in defense position, 
you can’t attack any other monster!

00:19:10.050 --> 00:19:13.260
Then I set one card and end my turn.

00:19:14.050 --> 00:19:16.920
The card I set is the trap 
card Morphtransition.

00:19:16.920 --> 00:19:19.620
It negates attacks against 
Morphtronic monsters.

00:19:19.620 --> 00:19:23.270
If I bring out another Morphtronic 
Magnen on my next turn,

00:19:23.270 --> 00:19:28.150
they'll form a magnetic lock, and 
he won’t be able to attack!

00:19:29.440 --> 00:19:31.050
Stop, Lua!

00:19:31.050 --> 00:19:33.750
Find a way to stop this duel!

00:19:33.750 --> 00:19:35.950
Yusei, I'll protect Luca!

00:19:35.950 --> 00:19:38.660
So I have to defeat him with my own hands!

00:19:40.890 --> 00:19:42.030
Lua…

00:19:42.030 --> 00:19:44.890
All we can do is hope that Lua wins.

00:19:53.330 --> 00:19:54.710
This place is…

00:19:58.870 --> 00:20:00.950
What happened?

00:20:02.930 --> 00:20:04.120
Kuribon!

00:20:05.610 --> 00:20:08.810
Ancient Fairy Dragon is 
sealed in that mountain.

00:20:08.810 --> 00:20:12.280
This is the spirit world.

00:20:13.250 --> 00:20:14.790
My turn.

00:20:15.240 --> 00:20:16.490
I draw.

00:20:17.160 --> 00:20:19.760
I summon Magician Ape.

00:20:23.610 --> 00:20:27.820
It has 800 attack points.  That's the same 
as Morphtronic Magnen's defense points.

00:20:27.820 --> 00:20:32.360
That means Morphtronic Magnen can’t be 
destroyed this turn.  On my next turn…

00:20:33.180 --> 00:20:36.350
I activate Magician Ape’s effect.

00:20:36.920 --> 00:20:42.400
Once a turn, by sending one card 
in my hand to the graveyard,

00:20:42.400 --> 00:20:45.760
Magician Ape can take control 
of one of your monsters.

00:20:50.270 --> 00:20:54.230
Next, Magician Ape attacks you directly!

00:20:59.940 --> 00:21:01.160
Lua!

00:21:07.110 --> 00:21:11.820
Was that Lua’s voice?  
Is Lua fighting?  Why?

00:21:15.730 --> 00:21:18.620
What’s this pain?

00:21:18.620 --> 00:21:21.520
It’s stronger than when I fought Divine.

00:21:21.520 --> 00:21:24.730
It's the pain of a shadow duel, kid.

00:21:24.730 --> 00:21:29.500
I’ll try not to hurt you too much before 
sending your soul to the afterlife.

00:21:29.670 --> 00:21:32.660
I'm showing you mercy.

00:21:34.240 --> 00:21:35.470
Luca…

00:21:36.160 --> 00:21:37.410
Lua…

00:21:56.840 --> 00:22:01.310
We look up and vow towards the shining light

00:22:01.670 --> 00:22:06.380
We will build our own future

00:22:06.850 --> 00:22:11.820
The far dawn shines blindingly

00:22:12.280 --> 00:22:16.990
Awaken in the wonderland

00:22:22.590 --> 00:22:32.130
The overflowing wave of emotions approaches

00:22:32.560 --> 00:22:37.700
This world can’t be solved using algorithms

00:22:37.770 --> 00:22:42.410
Even if it loses its light

00:22:42.880 --> 00:22:47.680
The hourglass behind the 
heart can’t be turned

00:22:47.680 --> 00:22:52.150
Roll the dice and get 
out and follow the light

00:22:52.350 --> 00:22:57.730
Fly towards tomorrow faster than a heartbeat

00:22:57.860 --> 00:23:02.540
This journey has no end

00:23:02.830 --> 00:23:08.070
There’s no meaning 
because there are no tears

00:23:08.500 --> 00:23:13.310
Hear my voice
